{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22074","headline":"新乐府 卖炭翁\t苦官市也 · 白居易","name":"新乐府 卖炭翁\t苦官市也","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卖炭翁，伐薪烧炭南山中。\n满面尘灰烟火色，两鬓苍苍十指黑。\n卖炭得钱何所营，身上衣裳口中食。\n可怜身上衣正单，心忧炭贱愿天寒。\n夜来城上一尺雪，晓驾炭车辗冰辙。\n牛困人饥日已高，市南门外泥中歇。\n翩翩两骑来是谁，黄衣使者白衫儿。\n手把文书口称敕，回车叱牛牵向北。\n一车炭，千余斤，官使驱将惜不得。\n半匹红纱一丈绫，系向牛头充炭直。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}